\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {13}{\ignorespaces Representative spatial visualization for random-missing completion on CAVE. The columns show, in order, the original image, the masked observation input, Tucker completion, NTD-PL completion, the missing-only error of Tucker, the missing-only error of NTD-PL, and the missing-only error-reduction map. The last column is defined as Tucker $-$ NTD-PL, so positive values indicate that NTD-PL further reduces the completion error at the missing entries.}}{36}{figure.13}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:cave-completion-visual-app}{{13}{36}{Representative spatial visualization for random-missing completion on CAVE. The columns show, in order, the original image, the masked observation input, Tucker completion, NTD-PL completion, the missing-only error of Tucker, the missing-only error of NTD-PL, and the missing-only error-reduction map. The last column is defined as Tucker $-$ NTD-PL, so positive values indicate that NTD-PL further reduces the completion error at the missing entries}{figure.13}{}}
